<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.52 pct, 3-mo 21.27 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.52 pct, 3-mo 21.27 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) rose to 21.52 percent, up 0.02 percent, for the one-month maturity, and to 21.27 percent for the three-month maturity, up 0.01 on Tuesday's rate, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Wednesday on its  BUBOR Reuters page. -- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
